[en.FOCUS_C18_YANG]
Yang

[en.FOCUS_C18_YANG_desc]
Unlike Rain Shine’s “Silence”, Autumn Blaze does not believe that the fate of the Kirins must be limited to that unchanging stillness.\nBeing proactive is by no means synonymous with conflict, and openness and development are by no means the end of the Kirins. Silence is not the only antidote to Niriks, and poverty is not the best state of innocence.\n“Movement gives rise to yang, extreme movement leads to stillness; stillness gives rise to yin, extreme stillness leads to movement.”\nWe will break out of the cycles, and the Kirins will have its own voice in this world.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_YANG]
阳

[zh.FOCUS_C18_YANG_desc]
不同于雨晴的“静默”，秋烨不认为麒麟族的宿命必须限定在那一成不变的静止中。\n积极进取绝不是矛盾冲突的代名词，开放与发展绝不是麒麟族的末日。静默不是逆麟的唯一解药，贫穷不是天真的最佳状态。\n“动而生阳，动极而静；静而生阴，静极复动。”\n我们将会跳出那一轮轮循环，麒麟族将在这个世界上拥有自己的声音。

